cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this monograph, the StarSec framework specifications, or the simulation tooling in your research or mission design, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Starlink: Architectural, Astrodynamic, and Cryptographic Engineering of a Low Earth Orbit Mega-Constellation & The StarSec Framework"
abstract: "A comprehensive technical monograph, open-source security framework (StarSec CSF v1.0), and reproducible simulation suite examining SpaceX's Starlink constellation across orbital mechanics, phased-array antenna physics, optical inter-satellite networking, hardware fault injection resilience, post-quantum cryptography, and space cyber threat modeling."
